     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Hello colleagues,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">I will be taking up a post at the University of St Andrews this summer and one of my responsibilities will be to oversee (and try and make a success of!) the newly launched taught <a href=\"https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/subjects/statistics/statistical-ecology-msc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/subjects/statistics/statistical-ecology-msc/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494345576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3vVyrLjHsSoD_vzcQkZJZM\">MSc in Statistical Ecology</a>. At the moment, we are looking to advertise this program as far and wide as possible, the target audience being undergraduate students graduating from biological, ecological and environmental science, and graduates from mathematical sciences looking to develop specialist skills in this area.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">We have a program poster and brochure which we can send to people willing to display them in their departments/organizations. If you are interested in helping spread the word to your students colleagues etc.., please add your info here: <a href=\"https://t.co/7iuPrs3Lwz?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://t.co/7iuPrs3Lwz?amp%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494345576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14zHH84HsMz5cQ5MLcp4Zs\">https://t.co/7iuPrs3Lwz?amp=1</a>.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">We will send you hard and electronic versions of the poster and brochure. Feel free also to pass this on to anyone you think might be interested in getting a the material.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Many thanks in advance, and happy new year!<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">While I may be sending this email outside of my normal office hours, I have no expectation to receive a reply outside of yours.<u></u><u></u></span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\"><u></u> <u></u></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\">Chris Sutherland </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\">(he/his)</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Assistant Professor</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Department of Environmental Conservation</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">University of Massachusetts-Amherst</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Rm 118, Holdsworth Hall</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Amherst, MA 01003-9285</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">W: <a href=\"https://eco.umass.edu/people/faculty/sutherland-chris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eco.umass.edu/people/faculty/sutherland-chris/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494345576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MGnbDuTcO07Y8g4tPvDDR\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">Sutherland Page</span></a></span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">E: <a href=\"https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__csutherland-40umass.edu&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=lDF7oMaPKXpkYvev9V-fVahWL0QWnGCCAfCDz1Bns_w&amp;r=qlZVmQqy67ulHmyO7RNHSc_qTAvjyijKbCvx5JD_gWPdQU_l7KgZCk8l5ewn3wZT&amp;m=j-VIe9hG5jMFmus6QCC2UE_32CVezji23PCcXkmqwEU&amp;s=dYt_I6J4eWu0p8xsHbIYHXn95i-3fuDKd5dziTibc_Y&amp;e=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u%3Dhttp-3A__csutherland-40umass.edu%26d%3DDwMFaQ%26c%3DlDF7oMaPKXpkYvev9V-fVahWL0QWnGCCAfCDz1Bns_w%26r%3DqlZVmQqy67ulHmyO7RNHSc_qTAvjyijKbCvx5JD_gWPdQU_l7KgZCk8l5ewn3wZT%26m%3Dj-VIe9hG5jMFmus6QCC2UE_32CVezji23PCcXkmqwEU%26s%3DdYt_I6J4eWu0p8xsHbIYHXn95i-3fuDKd5dziTibc_Y%26e%3D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494345576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aH6r9FDhXeWEj8LxYcopm\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">csuth...@umass.edu</span></a></span><span style=\"color: